{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WarStation</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dynamic shooter for those who want everything at once: intense shootouts, tactical planning, colorful landscapes and unique weapons. Choose the ideal character and gun for you and prove your superiority!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808950/extras/6d3927190e5d350f6436b5803e777465.avif?t=1754022907\" width=616 height=240 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><strong>Military</strong> <br>A realistic VR shooter designed for those who want to test themselves in conditions as close to a real battle as possible. Every decision you make becomes fateful: it will either lead your team to victory or make you vulnerable to the enemy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808950/extras/7f672e2599496d5b4b410ac69986a53d.avif?t=1754022907\" width=616 height=240 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><strong>Anime</strong>  <br>Friendly scenarios, picturesque locations and 30 unique animals to catch. Fight off enemies, catch magical animals and become a hero of the miracle universe!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808950/extras/4544cd13fe2c29201ec9999d750cb1ea.avif?t=1754022907\" width=616 height=240 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br><strong>Kids</strong>  <br>A collection of VR games. Accessible and exciting mechanics hold attention and allow kids to develop while playing. And also expand the boundaries of imagination and form a creative personality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808950/extras/d247847836ab42e7f34291e6af2ad653.avif?t=1754022907\" width=616 height=240 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br><strong>Family</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A set of exciting and fun mini-games to make guests come to the arena again and again, and each time find something new for themselves. Children's birthday, family evening or team building with colleagues - the Family collection will make any holiday unforgettable!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808950/extras/27fba35e6108ec30c58df8cd70130455.avif?t=1754022907\" width=616 height=240 /></span>  </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3808950?t=1754022907","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3808950?t=1754022907","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808950/f7e423927ef23c5f5758315db32177aec7df8278/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754022907","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808950/f7e423927ef23c5f5758315db32177aec7df8278/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754022907","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WarStation</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dynamic shooter for those who want everything at once: intense shootouts, tactical planning, colorful landscapes and unique weapons. Choose the ideal character and gun for you and prove your superiority!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/